  "description": "A Brompton Electric fits the needs of the ultimate urban commuter and provides assistance when you need it. Ride up hills, into the wind, and fly between meetings with great ease - be sure to arrive fresh every time. All Brompton Electric bikes come with a detachable battery bag.\n\nThe Brompton E-bike H6L in high gloss black features an H-type handlebar, supporting a more upright riding style, and it boasts a full range of 6 gears covering all riding needs. It also includes an extended seatpost and mudguards.\n\nThe Brompton Electric folds into a compact package so you can charge and store it safely inside your home or workplace. All of the electric bikes come with the standard battery bag (Essential bag), which has a 1.5L pocket to fit your essentials or your charger. Take your Brompton to the next level.",
